<li>wiwit 1968: &lt;a href="Jimmy%20Connors"&gt;Jimmy Connors&lt;/a&gt;; &lt;a href="Pete%20Sampras"&gt;Pete Sampras&lt;/a&gt;; &lt;a href="Roger%20Federer"&gt;Roger Federer&lt;/a&gt;, 5</li>
