<doc id="42691" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=42691" title="Pulo Alcatraz">
Pulo Alcatraz

Pulo Alcatraz iku sawijining &lt;a href="pulo"&gt;pulo&lt;/a&gt; sing dunungé ing tengah &lt;a href="Teluk%20San%20Francisco"&gt;Teluk San Francisco&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="California"&gt;California&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;. Alcatraz dumunung ing koordinat &lt;a href="http%3A//kvaleberg.com/extensions/mapsources/index.php%3Fparams%3D37_49_N_122_25_W_"&gt;37°49' LU 122°25' BB&lt;/a&gt;. Alcatraz biyèn minangka bètèng pertahanan militèr lan sabanjuré dadi &lt;a href="pakunjaran"&gt;pakunjaran&lt;/a&gt; kaamanan-ketat. Saiki dadi sawijing situs sajarah sing dikelola déning &lt;a href="Dinas%20Pertamanan%20Nasional%20Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Dinas Pertamanan Nasional&lt;/a&gt; AS minangka &lt;a href="Papan%20Rekreasi%20Nasional%20Golden%20Gate"&gt;Papan Rekreasi Nasional Golden Gate&lt;/a&gt; lda sing dibuka kango wisatawan. Pulo iki kadaftar minangka &lt;a href="Tempat%20Bersejarah%20Nasional"&gt;Tempat Bersejarah Nasional&lt;/a&gt;.
Jembar tlatah Alcatrasz kurang luwih 0,0763&amp;nbsp;km². Miturut &lt;a href="Sensus%20Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat%2C%202000"&gt;Sensus 2000&lt;/a&gt; pulo kang ora sing ndunungi.
Pulau yang dikenal juga sebagai "The Rock," (Batu Karang) ini ditampilkan dalam &lt;a href="fil"&gt;fil&lt;/a&gt;m 1996 &lt;a href="Film"&gt;movie&lt;/a&gt; dengan judhul &lt;a href="The%20Rock%20%28filem%29"&gt;yang sama&lt;/a&gt;. Puluhan filem, kalebu &lt;a href="Escape%20From%20Alcatraz"&gt;Escape From Alcatraz&lt;/a&gt; dan, telah menampilkan Alcatraz sejak 1937.
<h2>Panampilan</h2>
Panampilan.
Sesawangan &lt;a href="pulo"&gt;pulo&lt;/a&gt; Alcatraz kere dipigunakaké kanggo nggambaraké lokasi San Francisco. Sinawangan iki duwé peranan sajeroning sawatara &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="buku"&gt;buku&lt;/a&gt;, lan dolanan &lt;a href="video"&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;:
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Birdman%20of%20Alcatraz"&gt;Birdman of Alcatraz&lt;/a&gt; dibintangi olèh &lt;a href="Burt%20Lancaster"&gt;Burt Lancaster&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Escape%20from%20Alcatraz%20%28filem%29"&gt;Escape from Alcatraz&lt;/a&gt; dibintangi olèh &lt;a href="Clint%20Eastwood"&gt;Clint Eastwood&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Murder%20in%20the%20First"&gt;Murder in the First&lt;/a&gt; dibintangi olèh &lt;a href="Kevin%20Bacon"&gt;Kevin Bacon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Christian%20Slater"&gt;Christian Slater&lt;/a&gt; dan &lt;a href="Gary%20Oldman"&gt;Gary Oldman&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>A major pharmaceutical company in safeguards its antidote to the mutant gene on Alcatraz. The final battle takes also place at Alcatraz.</li>
<li>It is the hideaway for the villians in &lt;a href="The%20Enforcer%20%281976%20filem%29"&gt;The Enforcer&lt;/a&gt;, and appears in the final battle.</li>
<li>It is the base of the renegades in &lt;a href="The%20Rock%20%28filem%29"&gt;The Rock&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Al%20Capone%20Does%20My%20Shirts"&gt;Al Capone Does My Shirts&lt;/a&gt;, a novèl about a boy and his &lt;a href="autism"&gt;autistic&lt;/a&gt; sister living on Alcatraz Island</li>
<li>Helping Al Capone escape from Alcatraz is a major plot point in the role-playing video game.</li>
<li>On the TV-series &lt;a href="Charmed"&gt;Charmed&lt;/a&gt; in the episode &lt;a href="The%20Power%20of%20Two"&gt;The Power of Two&lt;/a&gt;, Phoebe and Prue hunt the ghost of a murderer executed at and until now haunting Alcatraz who has now escaped to the mainland and started killing again.</li>
<li>dan &lt;a href="San%20Francisco%20Rush%202049"&gt;San Francisco Rush 2049&lt;/a&gt;, both of which were developed by &lt;a href="Atari%20Games"&gt;Atari Games&lt;/a&gt;, have an Alcatraz-themed course to race on.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Tony%20Hawk%27s%20Pro%20Skater%204"&gt;Tony Hawk's Pro Skater 4&lt;/a&gt; also has Alcatraz as a playable level.</li>
<li>The radio series &lt;a href="Gang%20Busters"&gt;Gangbusters&lt;/a&gt; presented a dramatised version of the 1946 &lt;a href="Alcatraz%20Prison%20Riot"&gt;Alcatraz Prison Riot&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Midtown%20Madness%202"&gt;Midtown Madness 2&lt;/a&gt; has San Fransisco as a playable level, where Alcatraz Island is viewable in the distance, though it is not reachable.</li>
<li>In the &lt;a href="DC%20Universe"&gt;DC Universe&lt;/a&gt;, there is a metahuman prison located on Alcatraz Island. The new &lt;a href="Titans%20Tower"&gt;Titans Tower&lt;/a&gt; is built across from it, both as an intimidation tool and as a way to provide instant metahuman support in the case of a breakout.</li>
<li>The prison is also featured in the game, C&amp;C Red Alert 2 &lt;a href="Yuri%27s%20Revenge"&gt;Yuri's Revenge&lt;/a&gt;, which Yuri used the island for his psychic dominator superweapon.</li>
<li>At the Winston Cup(now Nextel cup) race at Infineon Raceway in 2002, it was toured by &lt;a href="Jeff%20Gordon"&gt;Jeff Gordon&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="Chris%20Myers"&gt;Chris Myers&lt;/a&gt; in the pre-race show.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="The%20Andy%20Griffith%20Show"&gt;The Andy Griffith Show&lt;/a&gt; episode "The Big House", Barney Fife(Don Knotts) makes a reference to "the Rock" when he tries to make the Mayberry courthouse a big city jail.</li>
<li>Mentioned in the lyrics of the song: &lt;a href="Lydia%20the%20Tattooed%20Lady"&gt;Lydia the Tattooed Lady&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>The videogame &lt;a href="The%20Suffering%20%28video%20game%29"&gt;The Suffering&lt;/a&gt; is set on a prison on an island called Carnate. Aswell as the location, Carnate shares many other similarities with Alcatraz#ALIH, such as the military history.</li>
<li>The movie &lt;a href="So%20I%20Married%20An%20Axe%20Murderer"&gt;So I Married An Axe Murderer&lt;/a&gt; features a scene where two main characters take a tour of the prison, including a gruesome story about &lt;a href="Machine%20Gun%20Kelly"&gt;Machine Gun Kelly&lt;/a&gt;.--&gt;</li>
