<li>&lt;a href="Sidhatan%20Houston"&gt;Sidhatan Houston&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, dawa 56 mil (91&amp;nbsp;km), ngubungaké &lt;a href="Houston%2C%20Texas"&gt;Houston, Texas&lt;/a&gt; karo &lt;a href="Teluk%20Meksiko"&gt;Teluk Meksiko&lt;/a&gt;.</<li>
